Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: querencia-files
Description: Querencia Desktop file search (alpha)
 Querencia Dateisuche is the "Search for Files" tool of Querencia Desktop,
 a classic desktop in the style of GNOME 2, modelled on
 gnome-search-tool: search by name, content, size, date and owner, without
 an index service.
 The interface is English with a German translation (gettext).
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
